libsetup origins and notices

sdk/libsetup/*.c and the public headers: MIT (sdk/LICENSE).
apps/control/configuration.c: MIT, shared configuration serializers using
libreg and the desktop settings format.
apps/desktop/settings_io.c: MIT, the destination-aware durable file writer
used by both Control Panel and offline Setup; its worker is not started by Setup.
src/kernel/net/config.c: CiukiOS GPL-2.0-only; the f2-100 NETWORK.INI codec,
compiled unchanged in behavior for the native library and the kernel.
The archive therefore contains project GPL-2.0-only code as well as MIT code.
No third-party code was vendored for this integration.

The dependency libdisk has its own mixed-license notice (licenses/libdisk.txt).
